ब्रह्मसूत्रपदैश्चैव हेतुमद्भ‍िर्विनिश्चितै: ॥ ५ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3632,\"bb\":3200,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/5/b3200/\",\"body_value\":\"ṛṣibhir bahudhā gītaṁ
chandobhir vividhaiḥ pṛthak
brahma-sūtra-padaiś caiva
hetumadbhir viniścitaiḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3633,\"bb\":3201,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/5/b3201/\",\"shadow_value\":\"ṛṣibhiḥ – by the wise sages; bahudhā – in many ways; gītam – described; chandobhiḥ – by Vedic hymns; vividhaiḥ – various; pṛthak – variously; brahma-sūtra – of the Vedānta; padaiḥ – by the aphorisms; ca – also; eva – certainly; hetu-madbhiḥ – with cause and effect; viniścitaiḥ – certain.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"ṛṣibhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"by the wise sages\"},{\"word\":\"bahudhā\",\"translation\":\"in many ways\"},{\"word\":\"gītam\",\"translation\":\"described\"},{\"word\":\"chandobhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"by Vedic hymns\"},{\"word\":\"vividhaiḥ\",\"translation\":\"various\"},{\"word\":\"pṛthak\",\"translation\":\"variously\"},{\"word\":\"brahma-sūtra\",\"translation\":\"of the Vedānta\"},{\"word\":\"padaiḥ\",\"translation\":\"by the aphorisms\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"hetu-madbhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"with cause and effect\"},{\"word\":\"viniścitaiḥ\",\"translation\":\"certain\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3634,\"bb\":3202,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/5/b3202/\",\"body_value\":\"That knowledge of the field of activities and of the knower of activities is described by various sages in various Vedic writings. It is especially presented in Vedānta-sūtra with all reasoning as to cause and effect.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3635,\"bb\":3203,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/5/b3203/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3636,\"bb\":3204,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/5/b3204/\",\"body_value\":\"The word chandobhiḥ refers to the various Vedic literatures. The Taittirīya Upaniṣad, for example, which is a branch of the Yajur Veda, describes nature, the living entity and the Supreme Personality of Godhead.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3637,\"bb\":3205,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/5/b3205/\",\"body_value\":\"$26\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3638,\"bb\":3206,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/5/b3206/\",\"body_value\":\"It is mentioned here that the codes of the Brahma-sūtra are very nicely arranged according to cause and effect. Some of the sūtras, or aphorisms, are na viyad aśruteḥ (2.3.2), nātmā śruteḥ (2.3.18), and parāt tu tac-chruteḥ (2.3.40). The first aphorism indicates the field of activities, the second indicates the living entity, and the third indicates the Supreme Lord, the summum bonum among all the manifestations of various entities.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 13.5\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 13.5\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2b:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n31:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"defa